WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
Let's start with a practical question.
How does a banking team improve release

00:00:03.731 --> 00:00:07.600
confidence when more testers are sharing
the same constrained environments?

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.840
Our Banking Client is a fictional payment
scenario with seventy-five offshore

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.760
quality assurance staff.
We will follow the manual work,

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.360
the platform foundations,
and the places where AI can assist.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.640
The ambition is repeatable
quality at scale.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:27.120
The story describes a proposed
path and testable outcomes,

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.120
not a reported client transformation.
